  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Slice the mixed peppers into thin strips and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Drizzle the peppers with a little bit of oil and roast in the oven for 20 minutes.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the chickpeas, cucumber, carrots, and mustard.",
    "Once the peppers are done roasting, let them cool and then add them to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Warm the whole wheat tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wraps by spooning the pepper and chickpea mixture onto the center of the tortilla and drizzling with ssam wrap sauce.",
    "Top the wraps with crunchy fried onions and serve immediately."
  ],
